# a given module uses it: an unused @prefix is valid Turtle, while a USED-but-undeclared one makes the
# file unparseable, and which prefixes a module needs depends on its sidecar. bios: and dqv: were
# missing and broke 5 of 16 modules, which the OGC postprocess then reported once per composing
